{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12806","headline":"赠别华阴道士 · 韩翃","name":"赠别华阴道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫府先生旧同学，腰垂彤管贮灵药。\n耻论方士小还丹，好饮仙人太玄酪。\n芙蓉山顶玉池西，一室平临万仞溪。\n昼洒瑶台五云湿，夜行金烛七星齐。\n回身暂下青冥里，方外相寻有知己。\n卖鮓市中何许人，钓鱼坐上谁家子。\n青青百草云台春，烟驾霓衣白角巾。\n露叶独归仙掌去，回风片雨谢时人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}